# Deny by default. Explicitly allow only reviewed, original source and documentation.
*
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!SECURITY.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!requirements.txt
!docs/
!docs/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!.github/
!.github/**

# Local/generated content remains excluded even under allowed directories.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
backup/
*dump*
*.log
*.tmp
